\id COL  
\h Kolose 
\toc3 Kol 
\toc1 Kolose Tovetumagana Yadi Leta Paulo Givetokilumina 
\toc2 Kolose 
\mt1 Kolose Tovetumagana Yadi Leta Paulo Givetokilumina  
\is1 Kivemala  
\ip Paulo deliya gimiyamiya aku taidei meKolose yadi leta kadu Filimoni banae kwana Kolose ani yana leta givetokilumidi, ada badi Tikiko ke Onesimo inauwena.  
\ip Keke Paulo tauna yana laumamala wagaine Kolose ekalesiya gida yegemona aku Paulo Efeso gimiyamiya anatoveya, tubuiyana Efafilasi Kolose wagaine giimilina ke ekalesiya-nai givetubuyegemonina. (Kolose 1:7) E aku aimo bana Efafilasi Paulo gimatawena tovewala fwayafwaya faidiya, faina badiyavo iyegemona Kolose wagaine ada igaluvaluva tovetumagana ina nuvuyoyedi. Yadi fwaya taidei anafaiweya, evo vaita tovetumagana gilubodadi ke tokaikaiwabu kadu totoyogina aneloseyavo gabama nefanine imiyamiya ani ina awadavadavadi. Kaduwe yadi vewala vaita Yeisu keke Yaubada anaitaita anafaiweya aku au vaita tamo anelose anafaiweya. Kaduwe vaita Mosese yana veimeya ida itaveyabina. Ada au taidei anafaiweya yadi vewala aku Paulo taide yadi leta-nai wagaine gikivetunudi vaita Keliso anaitaita ani au Yaubada anaita anafaiweya, yadi kaikaiwabu aigaigabudi, ada Banae yoo tovetumagana debaidi. Keliso anakaibe-mowa kibababala vuvuna.  
\io1 Vona vesiule. \ior (1:1-2)\ior*  
\io1 Paulo meKolose faidiya givesiule Yaubada wagaine. \ior (1:3-14)\ior*  
\io1 Keliso yana kaiwabu kaduwe yana faisewa faina. \ior (1:15-23)\ior*  
\io1 Paulo yana gugai ekalesiya faidiya. \ior (1:24 - 2:5)\ior*  
\io1 Keliso anakaibe-mowa Banae vona velemoena vuvuna, e ada wana tunuvala-vagata wagaine. \ior (2:6 - 3:4)\ior*  
\io1 Gavadewa tovetumagana wa yawaidi evaguna ani adilauboda faina. \ior (3:5 - 4:1)\ior*  
\io1 Paulo givona asevatudi. \ior (4:2-6)\ior*  
\io1 Paulo yana vonavetalakafoi. \ior (4:7-18)\ior*  
\c 1  
\p
\v 1-2 Iya Paulo, Yeisu Keliso yana afositolo Yaubada yana nuwanuwa wagaine. Imi Yaubada yana yoo tabutabumiyavo wamiyamiya yana ekalesiya Kolose wagaine ani Iyayeku ada tubuiyada Timoti nodi yama vesiule wagaimiya. Imiyavo Keliso nodi waveseyana ada yami awaega ani toyogi-vagaina, keke gida kabekabebe. Tamada Yaubada yana nuwadogeya gina lemelememi ada kaduwe aseasemi gina kikiveniwalovina.   
\s1 Paulo meKolose faidiya givesiule Yaubada wagaine.  
\p
\v 3 Ime tova moyaina aveoveola faimiya\x † \xo 1:3 \xt Efes 6:18 \x* ada avesivesiule Yaubada wagaine, Banae yada Kauveya Yeisu Keliso Tamana.  
\v 4 Faina anogalina vaita yami vetumagana wasevelavelalaina yada Kauveya Yeisu wagaine, ada kaduwe Yaubada yana kaliva tabutabudiyavo moyaidi wanuwanuwakabubuyedi.  
\v 5 Nagona valeya iwakana wanogalina Yeisu faine, valeya-nai tainei Yaubada yana vona velemoena, ada wanuwaveyalaina vaita gavana Yaubada gikidewedewena faimiya gabameya ani wana nuwagana. E ada taidei yami nuwaveyalaina-nai faine, imiyavo Yeisu Keliso wavetuvetumaganena ada yana kaliva wanuwanuwakabubuyedi.  
\v 6 Taidei valeya-nai giela giakwalelega babi matatabuna wagaine ani gitabotabo ke giguwaguwa, e ada kaliva gavega ivetumaganena ani anaiwakana inuwanuwagana yawaidi wagaidiya. Ada kadu anafaiweya tova-nai gielai wagaimiya, wanogalina ke anaiwakana wanuwagana yawaimi wagaidiya. Ada yadayada-nai wagaine wanogalina, e au wagaine-deya Yaubada yana nuwadoga vewaga anavona velemoena walutovonina.\x † \xo 1:6 \xt Efes 1:13,15, 1Pi 1:3-4\x*  
\v 7 Valeya taidei anaalamana wavaina ani Efafilasi\x † \xo 1:7 \xt Kol 4:12, Fim 23\x* wagaine. Banae Keliso yana togugai anafaiweya imeyavo, ada anuwakabubuyena. Banae toidibumwaiga Keliso yana gugai wagaine ada amatoivaivaita imi faimiya,  
\v 8 ada kaduwe givonema vaita Aluwaluwa Tabuna guwana giseyegemonena wagaimiya e ada kaliva wanuwakabubuyedi velemoena.   
\p
\v 9 Taidei faina, yadayada-nai anogalina wagaine avebutu imi faimiya aveoveola ada keke ada ilova. Yaubada aveoveolena ke nuwami gina malina velemoena ada nuwauya gina velemi, e ada wana alamanena matatabuna gavana Yaubada yana nuwanuwa faimiya.  
\v 10 Taidei anafaiweya aveola e ada yawaimi wagaidiya wana dewadewa iwakana Kauveya Yeisu yana kaliva analauboda anafaiweya, e ada wana kivemwamwalina.\x † \xo 1:10 \xt Fip 1:27 \x* Anafaiweya ai giguwaguwa iwakana, ani imi wana gugugai iwakana wai tulina tulina wagaidiya,\x † \xo 1:10 \xt Efes 2:10\x* e ada Yaubada anaalamana guwana wagaimiya gina tabotabo-faila.  
\v 11 Aveola faimiya vaita Yaubada gina kiveasevatumi Tauna yana toyogina lakai-vagaina wagaine, toyogina-nai giyegemona yana kaikaiwabu wagaine-deya. E ada wa yami atuvefaila wana mididi toyogina, ada gavavita gina yegemona ani wa yami mwala nodi wana vetoefaefa.  
\v 12 Kaduwe aveoveola faimiya ke wana vesivesiule Tamada Yaubada wagaine, Banae gikivelaubodami e ada yana vutuvutuga iwakana wana nuwagana. Taidei vutuvutuga-nai yana kaliva tabutabudeyavo faideya gikidewedewena yana fafali-nai wagaine yana malina gimiyamiya. Taidei anafaiweya aveoveola imi faimiya.\x † \xo 1:12 \xt Efes 1:18-19 \x*  
\v 13 Faina Tamada gietoyavuda Seitani yana ebaveimeya yuyuvanina wagaine-deya aku gidamaneda Natu aseasena yana ebaveimeya wagaine.  
\v 14 Ada ide Natuna-nai nodi kaveseyana wagaine, adaetoyavuga kanuwagana. Yada dewa koyodi faidiya yogoyogodeyavo kamiyamiya aku Keliso dayagine gitutuveobuda, tainei yada koyona analaufata Banae gisena e ada yada koyona-dina givenuwaegedi.\x † \xo 1:14 \xt Efes 1:7-8 \x*   
\s1 Keliso yana kaiwabu kaduwe yana faisewa faina.  
\p
\v 15 Yeisu ani Banae Yaubada anaita ke yana veuluva anafaiweya. Ide tomiyababi keke adafaiweya Yaubada kanaita,\x † \xo 1:15 \xt Iyo 1:18 \x* aku Yeisu wagaine Yaubada anaita ke yana veuluva ani mamalina wagaideya. Muliya-yo gavagaitoma giyegemona babi anamatatabuna wagaine aku Yaubada Natuna gimiyamiya, ada Banae ani lakai-moena ayo ibuibubuna matatabuna.  
\v 16 Faina Banae-menai ani ibuibubuna matatabuna adiwai e ada iyegemona.\x † \xo 1:16 \xt Iyo 1:3 \x* Gaitoma-dina gabama wagaine ada babi wagaine, gaitoma-dina kaitaitadi ada gaitoma-dina keke adafata kana itaitadi, kaduwe gabama anakaliva kaikaiwabudiyavo, kai tokaikaiwabu, o kai totoyogina, o kai toveimeyayavo, o kai kauveyayavo tulina tulina, au matatabudi Natuna Keliso Banae-menai givewai faidiya ada iyegemona, ada Banae faine imiyamiya.  
\v 17 Ada Banae bademowa-deya gimiyamiya aku ibuibubuna matatabuna iyegemona,\x † \xo 1:17 \xt Iyo 1:1 \x* ada Banae-menai gaitoma matatabuna gikikiveyabidi seyana.  
\v 18 Ada kaliva kuluwana ani vovona giveiveimeyena anafaiweya, mamauwe Keliso Banae ani yana ekalesiya debaina. Banae ani nago-moena toyawa-vagila alika wagaine, e ada ide vovona ani Banae yawaida vuvuna. Taidei anafaiweya Banae wai ginago-moena ke gaitoma moyaidi gina kaiwabusegedi.\x † \xo 1:18 \xt Efes 1:22-23 \x*  
\v 19 Faina Yaubada ginuwamwala lakaina vaita yana iwakana mamalina, yana toyogina, yana nuwanuwa-dina ada yana veuluva ani matatabuna Natuna wagaine ina miyamiya.\f ** \fr 1:19 \ft Taidei anafaiweya Yaubada yana nuwanuwa e ada Natuna wagaine-deya Tauna gina ivemogatalina kaliva wagaidiya. (Kol 2:9) \f*  
\v 20 Ada kaduwe Yaubada ginuwamwala vaita Natuna wagaine ani yana ibuibubuna matatabuna gina veseyana-vagileda Tauna nodi,\x † \xo 1:20 \xt 2Kol 5:18, Efes 2:16\x* kai gaitoma-dina babiya o gaitoma-dina gabameya. E ada tova-nai Natuna gialika kelose wagaine ada dayagina gimadu, taidei wagaine kukuya gikiveyegemonina.   
\p
\v 21 Aku imiyavo tova nagona wagaine Yaubada wavenibainena yami nuwanuwa ke yami gugai koyodi wagaidiya,\x † \xo 1:21 \xt Kol 2:1-3,12 \x*  
\v 22 ani malinai au Banae Natuna vovona yana alika wagaine imiyavo giveseyana-vagilemi Tauna nodi.\x † \xo 1:22 \xt Efes 2:14-16 \x* Taidei wagaine Banae anafaiweya gina seyegemonemi tabutabumi Tauna matane. Keke tamo koyona wagaimiya e ada tamo gaito gida awavekoyoyemi aku yami dewa matatabuna yegayegana Banae matane.  
\v 23 E aku gilubodami tova moyaina taidei vona velemoena wana vetumaganena ada wana mididi toyogina wagaine.\x † \xo 1:23 \xt Ibel 6:11 \x* Tova-nai wanogalina valeya iwakana amikibababala faine, aga wavevuvu wanuwanuwavetumagana vaita wana nuwagana gavana Yaubada givonadabadabayena. E ada kai tova moyaina yami nuwavetumagana-nai wana kidonena e ada keke gina aliuliu ke wanasege, aga Keliso gina seyegemonemi tabutabumi Tauna matane. Taidei valeya iwakana bademowa ilumamalena tomiyababi fafali moyaina wagaidiya, ada Iya Paulo analaumamala-nai faine gavetogugai.   
\s1 Paulo yana gugai ekalesiya faidiya.  
\p
\v 24 Velemoena, tova malinai uloulolo moyaina gawaiwaidi. Aku imi faimiya gawaiwaidi e ada gikivemwamwaliku. Faina gavana Keliso giuloloyena ani keke gidaavai, aku Iya vovokuya ulolo-dina ganuwanuwagadi wagaidiya ani Bana yana uloulolo galuluyabuna. Tainei yana uloulolo-dina ide yana yoo faideya, Banae vovona, tainei yana yoo.  
\v 25 Ada Yaubada givenuwadadaneku ke gavetogugai Keliso yana yoo adilema faina. Ee, yaku gugai-nai ani Yaubada yana vona matatabuna gana kikivemalidi imi wagaimiya.  
\v 26 Tutuya tuwai-moena gavaiyei bademowa giavaidi ada kaliva adiyoo bademowa gavaiyei giavaidi ada wagaine gielai, ani Yaubada yana nuwanuwa keke gida ivemogatali kaliva wagaidiya e ada keke ida alamane, aku tova manamanawena sewasewavuyena gimiyamiya wagaidiya. Aku malinai tova-nai wagaine nuwanuwa-nai giivemogatalina ide yana kaliva tabutabudeyavo wagaideya.\x † \xo 1:26 \xt Efes 3:9, Lom 16:25-26 \x*  
\v 27 Ide wagaideya giivemogatalina faina nuwanuwana kana alamanena yana nuwanuwa sewasewavuyedi iwaka-vagaidi ke nuwavaivaidi. Taidei Yaubada yana nuwanuwa-dina sewasewavuyedi ani badi keke meIsileli faidiya, ada taide anafaiweya. Keliso wagaimiya gimiyamiya. Ada imi kadu wagaimiya Banae gimiyamiya faina, wanuwavetumagana vaita aimo Banae nodi yana iwakana mamalina wagaine wana miyamiya.   
\p
\v 28 Banae alulumamalena kaliva moyaidi wagaidiya, ada alamana-nai Yaubada givelema wagaine kaliva seyana seyana avonavonamatawedi ke avevewaledi. Faina nuwanuwama kaliva moyaidi nuwadi ginamali-yabuna Keliso yana wai faine ke yadi vetumagana wagaine ina asekumaga,\x † \xo 1:28 \xt Efes 4:13\x* e ada taide anafaiweya seyana seyana ana seyegemonedi Yaubada matane.  
\v 29 Taidei yaku nunu-nai anafaiweya faine gafaifaisewa toyogina. Keliso yana toyogina wagaine gavetoefaefa, toyogina-nai gifaifaisewa wagaikuya.\x † \xo 1:29 \xt Efes 1:19\x*   
\c 2  
\p
\v 1 Nuwanuwaku wana alamanena Iya gavetoefaefa amileme faina, imiyavo ke badiyavo gavega Leodisiya\f ** \fr 2:1 \ft Leodisiya ani melala lakaina mala ubeta waina Kolose anafafali, giobu ginau gufa Likasi agene-mwane. Paulo melala-nai giinanana faina gialamanena vaita tovetumagana Leodisiya wagaine aimo leta taidei ina veyawana. (Kol 4:16)\f* wagaine, ada badi kaduwe gavega tovetumagana Iya keke magigiku maita idaita.  
\v 2 Moyaimi faimiya gafaifaisewa toyogina, e ada wana asevatu yami awaega Keliso wagaine ada moyaimi wana venuwanuwakabubu ke wana veyoo seya-moena velemoena. Nuwanuwaku nuwami gina malina Yaubada yana nuwainage faina ada wana nuwaveyalaina vaita vona velemoena. Taidei wagaine yana nuwainage anaalamana wana vaina ada wana nuwauya, alamana-nai ani tuwaina keke gida ivemogatali, tainei Keliso Tauna.\x † \xo 2:2 \xt Efes 3:3-4,16-19\x*  
\v 3 Banae Keliso wagaine Yaubada yana alamana ke nuwamamala matatabuna imiyamiya, badiyavo kaikaiwabu sewasewavuyena anafaiweya.\x † \xo 2:3 \xt Ais 11:2, 1Kol 1:24,30, 2:6-7\x*  
\v 4 Taidei gaitoma-dina faidiya gavetokiluma wagaimiya e ada keke tamo gaito yana bonayafa wagaine vaita vona velemoena ani nuwami gina vaina ada gina fwayanegenegemi Yaubada yana wai tunutunugina faine.\x † \xo 2:4 \xt Lom 16:18 \x*  
\v 5 Iya keke imi nodi aku tova moyaina ganuwanuwa faimiya e ada vaita Iya ineneku imi nodi. Ada gavemwamwala valeyami faine. Tova moyaina imi taumiyavo waawaawatami ke waawaegemi velemoena Yaubada yana wai tunutunugina wagaine, ada kadu yami vetumagana Keliso wagaine keke wada kisege aku wakidonena e ada wamidimididi toyogina.   
\s1 Keliso anakaibe-mowa Banae vona velemoena vuvuna, e ada wana tunuvala-vagata wagaine.  
\p
\v 6 Taidei faina, Yeisu Keliso waawaege giluku wagaimiya ke Banae wasena amiToveimeya anafaiweya, gilubodana tova moyaina anafaiweya wana miyaveyalata Bana wagaine.  
\v 7 Ee, ai toyogina walamina giabidonau babi wagaine anafaiweya, imiyavo wana abidonau Yeisu wagaine e ada yami vetumagana gina tubutubuga ke wana mididi toyogina ivewalemi anafaiweya.\x † \xo 2:7 \xt Efes 3:16-18 \x* Ada yami vesiule ginamaga aiwaiwana.\x † \xo 2:7 \xt Efes 5:20\x*   
\p
\v 8 Aku kaliva tufodi ani yadi vewala ananogala anafaiweya alaalamanina velemoena, aku velemoena vuvuna ke guwana ani keke maita iwakana. E ada wana itaveyabimi wagaidiya, aenanai yami nuwanuwa ina vaina ke yadi fwaya wagaine ina vedaimi e ada wana vetomuliya wagaidiya. Yadi vewala-dina vuvudi ani kaliva-mowa yadi nuwanuwa ke yadi dewa tubudiyavo ivevewaledi, ada ivevewala babi taidei yana veimeya gaga faine. Keke Keliso wagaine vewala-dina ida vevuvu.  
\v 9 Faina Keliso anakaibe-mowa wagaine ani Yaubada yana iwakana mamalina, yana toyogina, ke yana veuluva matatabuna imiyamiya, taine Keliso vovona wagaine.\x † \xo 2:9 \xt Iyo 1:14 \x*  
\v 10 Ada Banae nodi waveseyana faina, yawai velemoena wagaine bademowa givemagami, ada aluwaluwami keke tamo gavana wagaine gida vemaufo. Ada Banae Keliso gavega moyaidi tokaikaiwabu ada badi totoyogina imiyamiya gabameya ani gikaiwabusegedi.\x † \xo 2:10 \xt Efes 1:20-22 \x*  
\v 11 Ada imiyavo yami veseyana Keliso nodi wagaine ani kaduwe Yaubada yana iyaiyaya wavaina, taine imiyavo itomogoloimi, aku keke tomogolota-nai kaliva nimadi wagaine aku Keliso Bana gifaisewana. Tainei tomogolota-nai ani babi anadewa-dina koyodi aseasemiya gitomogoloi-yavuledi.\x † \xo 2:11 \xt Lom 2:28-29 \x*  
\v 12 Tova-nai wababitaiso ani imi vaita waalika ke Keliso nodi itavumi anafaiweya. Ada Yaubada Keliso gisiveyawana toalika adimwatuguya ani yana toyogina wavetumaganena, e ada Yaubada imi kaduwe gisiveyawami ke Keliso nodi wayawa-vagila.\x † \xo 2:12 \xt Lom 6:4-5\x*   
\p
\v 13 Aku imiyavo ani tova giavaina muliya-yo wavetumagana Keliso wagaine, imi vaita toalika anafaiweya. Faina tova moyaina Yaubada yana veimeya wayaweyawelina ada babi ananuwanuwa dibune wamiyamiya. Aku Yaubada Yeisu gisiveyawana anafaiweya, imi kaduwe gisiveyawami ke Keliso nodi wamiyamiya yawaimi evaguna wagaine. Faina Yaubada yana veimeya moyaida kayawelidi ani matatabuna givenuwaegedi.\x † \xo 2:13 \xt Efes 2:1,4-5 \x*  
\v 14 Anafaiweya vaita yada koyona moyaina ivetokilumina fefe wagaine ke ina velena tovevonayavuga vonayavuga anatoveya. Aku Yaubada, Banae Tovevonayavuga, ani givaina ada gitutuvefosena kelose wagaine, wadedeku ide faideya Keliso matavuloga givaina yada koyona faidiya.\x † \xo 2:14 \xt Lom 7:4\x*  
\v 15 Keliso yana alika wagaine aluwaluwa bwanebwanenedi badiyavo iveiveimeya ani yadi veimeya yana toyogina giveyalilina aku gitoyogisegedi, e ada wa yadi vovomumu imiyamiya moyaidi matadiya.\x † \xo 2:15 \xt Iyo 12:31, 16:7-11, Efes 4:8, Ibel 2:14-15\x*   
\p
\v 16 Taidei faina gavana wakanikanina o kai wayuyuna ani keke gida luboda kaliva inavona venuwadadanemi faidiya.\x † \xo 2:16 \xt Lom 14:1-12 \x* Ada kai nuwanuwadi veimeya inasedi yadayada vevewagadi malamala seyana seyana faine, o vaikoi evaguna faina, o Sabate faine, keke bonadi wana nogali.  
\v 17 Taidei gaitoma-dina ani vaita kaliva anununa kauwana wagaine kaitana anafaiweya. Givewavewaleda gavaiyamu kaliva velemoena anaita. Aku kaliva-moena bademowa giyegemona ani Keliso.  
\v 18 Kaliva tufodi nuwanuwadi lakaina vita ina kikiveyegemonidi taudiyavo vovodi faidiya, ada ioduodu aneloseyavo wagaidiya. Ada kaduwe gavana iitana adivewala iyegemona wagaidiya ani faidiya ikikivemala lakaina, anafaiweya vaita yadi alamana lakaina ayo mali kaliva. E ada kai inaela ina itatagomi aga keke bonadi wana nogali. Velemoena yadi nuwanuwa-dina ani keke Yaubada yana kivemala wagaine aku ivevuvu taudiyavo yadi nuwenuweya, e ada yadi nuwalaka keke wa vuvuna.  
\v 19 Banae gaito anafaiweya ani yana veseyana Keliso nodi ani keke, aku gimiyamiya tabae. Keliso ani Bana anafaiweya kuluwada gikulikuligada aku ideyavo anafaiweya vovona. Ada aa vovoda gikikivetoyogidi anafaiweya, kadu Banae gikikivetoyogida. Ada vovo anatubo ke tubo anawaloga lakaidi vovo aditalai ikikiveyabidi seyana anafaiweya, kadu Bana gikikiveyabida. Taide wai-nai wagaine Yaubada gikikivetoyogida e ada yada vetumagana gitabotabo. Ada ideyavo Keliso yana ekalesiya wagaine kamiyamiya, e ada yana ekalesiya ani toyogina ada giveiveinala.\x † \xo 2:19 \xt Efes 4:15-16 \x*   
\p
\v 20 Aku imiyavo bademowa waawaegemi Keliso wagaine ada Banae nodi waalika, ada kaliva alialikana keke babi yana veimeya dibune anafaiweya, kaduwe imiyavo keke-mowa aimo yana veimeya dibune. E aku gavaiyamu-yo wadewadewa vaita keke Banae nodi wada alika ada imi babi anakalivayavo ke babi yana veimeya dibune wasesemi?\x † \xo 2:20 \xt Lom 6:2, Gal 4:3-5,9 \x*  
\v 21 Veimeya-dina ani taidei anafaiweya. “Taidei gaitoma-nai awaawatana, keke wana kiveyabi. Taidei aa-nai awaawatana, keke wanakani. Taidei gaitoma-nai awaawatana, keke wana vegugaiye.”  
\v 22 Taidei gaitoma-dina matatabuna adivegugai avaavaidi. Ada taidei veimeya-dina ani kaliva-mowa gagana yadi veimeya ke yadi vewala, keke Yaubada yana nuwanuwa wagaine.\x † \xo 2:22 \xt Ais 29:13, Mad 15:9\x*  
\v 23 Velemoena, kaliva tufodi inuwanuwa vaita veimeya-dina adinuwanuwa ani iwakadi. Aku velemoena keke. Badiyavo vewala-dina ivevewala ani kaliva ilulumodovedi vaita gilubodana vovodi keke ina itaveyabi aku ina vegugai kavokavovoyedi,\f ** \fr 2:23 \ft Tovewala-dina ivevewala vaita gilubodana kaliva vovodi keke ina itaveyabidi aku ina vegugai-kavokavovoyedi, faina inuwanuwa vaita taidei wagaine kaliva yadi nuwanuwa koyodi gina avaidi e ada Yaubada gina vemwamwala faidiya. Aku yadi nuwanuwa-nai ani balana.\f* veimeya vitadi wagaidiya ilulumodovedi ke taudiyavo ina kiobuyedi,\f ** \fr 2:23 \ft Nuwaobu-nai ivevewala ani kaliva matadi faine, keke wa anavelemoena.\f* ada kaduwe Yaubada anaoduodu faina iveiveimeyedi. E ada yadi vewala ananogala vaita badiyavo tonuwauya velemoena, aku keke. Vewala-dina keke-bamowa kaliva ina lemedi ke adifaiweya yadi nuwanuwa itaitaluvadigadi ina awatadi e ada keke ina gugaiyedi. E ada bonadi keke wana venogale.   
\c 3  
\p
\v 1 Imiyavo Keliso nodi ani Yaubada gisiveyawami alikeya faina,\x † \xo 3:1 \xt Kol 2:12\x* gilubodana yami nuwanuwa gina naunau gabama ananuwanuwa wagaidiya, wadedeku Keliso gimiyamiya. Banae Yaubada aiyatagine givetovetoga,\x † \xo 3:1 \xt Mak 16:19, Efes 1:20\x* ivi-nai wa anavemoimoina lakaina wagaine.  
\v 2 Yami nuwanuwa wanasena gabama ananuwanuwa wagaidiya aku keke babi ananuwanuwa.\x † \xo 3:2 \xt Mad 6:33 \x*  
\v 3 Faina imi bade waalika ada malinai wamiyamiya Keliso nodi ke waveseyana Yaubada nodi, e ada au imi kikibababalimi wamiyamiya.\x † \xo 3:3 \xt 2Kol 5:17, Lom 6:6-7 \x*  
\v 4 Keliso yawaimi evaguna vuvuna,\x † \xo 3:4 \xt Iyo 11:25\x* ada aimo tova-nai Banae wa yana iwakana mamalina gina yegemona, aga imi kaduwe nodi wana yegemona yana iwakana mamalina wagaine.\x † \xo 3:4 \xt 1Iyo 3:2\x*   
\s1 Gavadewa tovetumagana wa yawaidi evaguna ani adilauboda faina.  
\p
\v 5 Taidei faina, babi ananuwanuwa koyodi nuwamiya itabotabo ani wana abudi ina bovu. Wana dewedi anafaiweya vaita amigaviyayavo ada wana luvealikadi. Ina vovo anaawaege-kavokavovo, vovo ananuwanuwa ke anagugai bwanebwanenena, udo matafou, nuwanuwa kavu, giba anaitaluvadiga. E, badiyavo giba anaitaluvadiga nuwadi givaina ani aseasediya ioduodu giba-dina wagaidiya anafaiweya yaubada fwayafwaya wagaidiya ioduodu.\x † \xo 3:5 \xt 1Kol 6:9-10, Gal 5:19-21, Efes 5:1-5, 1Pi 2:1\x*  
\v 6 Taidei dewa-dina faidiya Yaubada yana nuwakoyo toyogi-moena gina vewala badi yana veimeya idibusoyogena wagaidiya.\x † \xo 3:6 \xt Lom 1:18 \x*  
\v 7 Nagona muliya-yo taumiyavo waawaegemi Keliso wagaine, dewa-dina adiwai iveiveimeyemi ada wagaidiya wanau.  
\v 8 E aku malinai gilubodami dewa-dina koyodi matatabuna wana dibusoyogedi.\x † \xo 3:8 \xt Lom 6:6, Efes 4:22\x* Keke wana nuwakoyo, keke wana veumagigi, keke wana nuwanuwa vaita tamo gaito wana kiveulouloloni, keke kaliva o kai Yaubada wana veveloidi e ada adiyegana wana ikikivekoyodi, ada keke vona koyona wana inainana.  
\v 9 Keke taumiyavo wagaimiya wana vefwayafwaya, faina nuwanuwa tuwaina anadewa koyona ani bademowa wavaiyavulena  
\v 10 aku malinai yawai evaguna anamiya wavevuvuna, e ada imi evagumiyavo. Ada yawai-nai gikive evagumi ani Yaubada anaitaita anafaiweya gibubuna, ada tova moyaina nuwami matatabuna gikikive evaguna anafaiweya Tauna yana uluva\x † \xo 3:10 \xt Lom 8:29\x* e ada wana alamane-dewedewena velemoena.\x † \xo 3:10 \xt Efes 4:24-32, Lom 12:2\x*  
\v 11 E ada moyaida Banae matane ani seyana. Keke anatulina kai meIsileli ada gavega keke meIsileli, badiyavo gavega vovodi bwatana tomotomogoloina\x † \xo 3:11 \xt Eba 17:10-27, Iyeg 12:48, Luk 1:59 ke anaailabama adiebakivemala\x* ada gavega keke tomotomogoloidi, badi memamataga, badi gavega Sitiya anafafali anakalivayavo,\f ** \fr 3:11 \ft Tova tuwaina fafali-nai Sitiya ani Eulasiya anafafali lakaina wagaine gimiyamiya, ada anakalivayavo meSitiya ani tomanini ke kaliva toagouga. Badi meSitiya ani mali kaliva yadi melala ilukulukudi ke kaliva imunumunudi ada kadu mali kivekoyo ikikiveyegemonidi. Kaliva imatamatausedi ke inuwenuwedi vaita badi tomanini golagola koyo-moedi.\f* badi gavega togugai yogoyogodiyavo ada gavega badi keke. Keke anatulina wagaideya, faina malinai ide moyaida kaveseyana Keliso yana yoo, ada Banae anakaibe-mowa kaiwabu, kaikaiwabu-moena velemoena, ada moyaida Banae wagaideya gimiyamiya.   
\s1 Wa yami nuwakabubu wana gugai iwakana kaliva wagaidiya.  
\p
\v 12 Imi Yaubada givenuwadadanemi yana kalivayavo ada gikivetabumi ke ginuwakabubuyemi velemoena. E ada gilubodami veigavu amilauboda anafaiweya wana osena, anafaiweya wana vetonuwakalikali, wa yami nuwakabubu kaliva wana dewedi iwakana, wana nuwaobu, wana dewabikana, ke wana atuvefaila.\x † \xo 3:12 \xt Gal 5:22-23, Efes 4:2\x*  
\v 13 Kai tamo gaito yana dewa keke iwakana matamiya e ada wagavoluvoluyena, aga auwe. Wana atuvefailena. Ada kai tamo gaito gina gugai koyona wagaimiya, gilubodana yana koyona-nai wana venuwaegena. Imi yami koyona ani Keliso givenuwaegena, e ada gilubodami anafaiweya kaduwe taumiyavo seyana seyana wana vevenuwaegau.\x † \xo 3:13 \xt Mad 6:14, Efes 4:32\x*  
\v 14 Taidei anafaiweya wana dewadewa, aku dewa seyana gilubodami velemoena ani imi taumiyavo wana venuwanuwakabubu. Venuwanuwakabubu-nai Keliso giveleveleda wagaine, taumiyavo wana yogomi seyana e ada yami miya anaita ani veseyana velemoena.\x † \xo 3:14 \xt Lom 13:8-10 \x*   
\p
\v 15 Ada kaduwe gilubodami Keliso yana nuwaniwalova gina veiveimeya nuwainagemiya.\x † \xo 3:15 \xt Iyo 14:27, Fip 4:7\x* Faina Yaubada imi givenuwadadanemi wana veyoo vovo seyana wagaine ke kukuya wagaine wana miyamiya. Ada wana vesivesiule.  
\v 16 Gilubodami Keliso yana vona wana nuwanuwayedi ke vona-dina nuwami gina vaina. E ada nuwamamala wana vaina e ayo tubuiyamiyavo wana vewavewaledi ke wana vekivetuvetunudi. Ada Same wagaidiya kadu Yaubada anakweli davadava ivetokilumina wagaidiya, ada kaduwe kweli-dina Aluwaluwa Tabuna gina alavelevelemi wagaidiya, ani wa yami vesiule wana kwelikweli Yaubada wagaine.\x † \xo 3:16 \xt Efes 5:19-20 \x*  
\v 17 Ada yami gugai matatabuna wagaine, kai wana ifuifufu o kai wana faifaisewa, aga wanadewa anafaiweya Kauveya Yeisu yana tonogalayavo adilauboda wagaine aku wana vesivesiule Tamada Yaubada wagaine Keliso anayeganeya.   
\s1 Keliso anatomuliya adiveimeya.  
\p
\v 18 Aku imi vevine naginagimiyavo, moganemiyavo yadi veimeya dibune wanamiya kenuwana,\x † \xo 3:18 \xt Efes 5:22, 1Pi 3:1-2 \x* faina imi tonogala vevine waveseyana Kauveya Yeisu nodi ada taidei dewa-nai amilauboda.   
\p
\v 19 Imi kaliva naginagimiyavo ani wa aseasemi vavinemiyavo wana nuwakabubuyedi. Keke wana vegaitoma-kavokavovoyedi ke wana agodadagedi.\x † \xo 3:19 \xt Efes 5:25, 1Pi 3:7 \x*   
\p
\v 20 Imi biyabiyama, inamiyavo ke tamamiyavo wana matawalewaleyedi gaitoma matatabuna wagaine, faina taidei dewa-nai Kauveya gikikivemwamwalina.   
\p
\v 21 Imi tama, keke natumiyavo wana kivenuwakoyo-kavokavovodi aenanai ina gadibudibusoyoga.\x † \xo 3:21 \xt Efes 6:4 \x*   
\p
\v 22 Imi togugai yogoyogomiyavo, amitoveimeyayavo babiya ani wana matawalewaleyedi yami gugai matatabuna wagaidiya. Keke vaita matadiya gaga wana matawalewale ke yadi nuwanuwa wanavai, aku imi yami Kauveya gabameya wa yami matauta wavemoimoinena faina, gilubodami amitoveimeya babi wagaine wa yami aseawaega velemoena wana matawalewaleyedi.\x † \xo 3:22 \xt Efes 6:5-8 \x*  
\v 23 Ada gavana gavana wafaisewana aga wa yami aseawaega nodi wana faifaisewa. Keke vaita kaliva gaga faidiya, aku Kauveya Yeisu adaToveimeya gabama wagaine faine.  
\v 24 Amitoveimeya-nai faine wafaifaisewa ani Banae Keliso, e ada waalamanena vaita aimo Banae wagaine amilaufata iwakana wana nuwagana, taine gaitoma iwakadi Banae gikidewedewedi yana kaliva faidiya.  
\v 25 Aku kai gaito seyana gigugugai koyona, aga koyona analaufata gina nuwagana ani koyona. Ada kai kaliva wa anayegana lakaina o kai togugai, e ani adilaufata keke tulina tulina aku au aigaigabudi.\x † \xo 3:25 \xt Gug 10:34\x*   
\c 4  
\p
\v 1 Aku imi toveimeyayavo yami togugai yogoyogodiyavo ifaifaisewa faimiya ani gilubodami dewa iwakanaga wagaidiya wana dewayena, keke wana ikoyokoyoyedi. Faina waalamanena imi kadu amiToveimeya wadedeku gabama wagaine gimiyamiya.\x † \xo 4:1 \xt Efes 6:9\x*   
\s1 Paulo givona asevatudi.  
\p
\v 2 Tova moyaina wana veoveola Yaubada wagaine. Ada yami veoveola-dina wagaidiya keke wana kabekabebe aku yami nuwanuwa gina toletole, ada wana vesivesiule Banae wagaine.  
\v 3 Ada kaduwe ime faimeya wana veoveola Yaubada wagaine ke wana gina yavuna faimeya e ada amafaiweya ana awamogatalena valeya tuwaina sewasewavuyena Keliso faine. Valeya-nai galumamalena faina, Iya yogoyogoku deliya gamiyamiya.  
\v 4 Wana veoveola ke akufata gana awatalatalainena mamalina, taidei gilubodaku anafaiweya.\x † \xo 4:4 \xt Efes 6:20 \x*   
\p
\v 5 Kaliva-dina keke Keliso wagaine yadi vetumagana idasei ani wana venuwadadana iwakana yami dewa wagaidiya, e ada gavatoveya tova iwakana ina yegemona aga Keliso yana dewa wagaimiya ina itanuwagana.\x † \xo 4:5 \xt Efes 5:16, 1Tes 4:11-12 \x*  
\v 6 Tova moyaina yami ifufu ananogala ani yami nuwadoga gida seyegemonena,\x † \xo 4:6 \xt Efes 4:29\x* ada yami vona ebanuwayaudi wagaidiya wana ifufu. E ada kai kaliva ina tolidadanemi Keliso faine, aga wana alamanena gavaiyamu seyana seyana wana lufata.\x † \xo 4:6 \xt 1Pi 3:15-16 \x*   
\s1 Paulo yana vonavetalakafoi.  
\p
\v 7 Valeyaku matatabuna ani Taikikasi\x † \xo 4:7 \xt Gug 20:4, Efes 6:21-22, 2Tim 4:12 \x* gina ifufuyena wagaimiya. Banae tubuiya aseasema kadu togugai dibudibumwaigina, ada Iya nodi afaifaisewa yada Kauveya faine.  
\v 8 Banae gaimilina wagaimiya e ada wana alamanena gavaiyamu yama miya, ada kaduwe aseasemi gina kiveasevatudi.  
\v 9 Gielaelai Onesimo\x † \xo 4:9 \xt Fim 1:10-20 \x* nodi, bana yami kaliva seyana. Banae toidibudibumwaiga Yeisu faine ada tubuiya aseasema anuwakabubuyena velemoena. Gavana matatabuna idedeku giyegeyegemona ani badi adiselu ina ifufuyena wagaimiya.   
\p
\v 10 Alisitako\x † \xo 4:10 \xt Gug 19:29, 27:2 \x* banae Iya nodi yogoyogoma ada Malika\x † \xo 4:10 \xt Gug 12:12, Fim 24 \x* bana Banabasi tubuiyana, badi adiselu yadi vona vesiule wagaimiya. Banae faine bademowa anamatawa wanuwagana, kai banae ginaelai wagaimiya aga mwaleya wana vagaulena.  
\v 11 Ada Ieisu,\f ** \fr 4:11 \ft Bana Ieisu ani keke Yeisu adaTokibababala, aku adiyegana anainana ani seyana.\f* banae kaduwe anayegana anavelu Yusita, yana vona vesiule. MeIsileli tovetumagana wagaidiya-deya badi aditoto gaga Iya nodi afaifaisewa Yaubada yana ebaveimeya faina, ada tova tova nuwaku ikiveiwakanena.  
\v 12 Efafilasi banae taumiyavo yami kaliva ada Yeisu Keliso yana togugai ani yana vona vesiule wagaimiya. Banae tova moyaina faimiya givedivediwe yana veoveola wagaidiya e ada wa yami asekumaga wana mididi toyogina yami vetumagana wagaine, ada Yaubada yana nuwanuwa matatabuna nuwami gina vaina velemoena ke wana alamanena gavana Banae nuwanuwana wanagai.  
\v 13 Iya tauku gaitana ke gamatawemi vaita bana gifaifaisewa toyogina faimiya, ada kaduwe badi tovetumagana Leodisiya ke Ilafoli melalidi wagaidiya.  
\v 14 Tubuiya aseasema Luke banae doketa ada Dimasi\x † \xo 4:14 \xt 2Tim 4:10, Fim 24\x* yadi vona vesiule wagaimiya.  
\v 15 Yaku vonanuwakabubu una vonedi badi tubuiyadeyavo Leodisiya wagaine, ada kaduwe novuda Nimipasi ada ekalesiya nodi imiyamiyavagauta yadi manuweya.   
\p
\v 16 Leta taidei seyana gaito gina veyawana wagaimiya muline, wana imilina Leodisiya ekalesiya wagaine ke badi kaduwe ina veyawana. Ada taidei anafaiweya leta-nai gavetokilumi ginau meLeodisiya wagaidiya ani ina imili ginaelai wagaimiya, ada imiyavo kaduwe wana veyawana.   
\p
\v 17 Kaduwe banae Akipasi wana vonena wana vonaga, “Una idibumwaiga ada faisewa-nai Kauveya giveleni ani wa ya atuvefaila unawai una gugaiyena, ada una luyabuna.”   
\p
\v 18 Taidei yaku vona vetalakafoi ani Iya Paulo tauku nimakuya gavetokilumina.\f ** \fr 4:18 \ft Paulo tubuiyana taidei leta-nai givetokilumina bana faine, aku anaebalauyabu wagaine Paulo feni givaina ada yana vetalakafoi givetokilumina e ada toveyawa ina alamanena banae tauna giimilina.\f* Iya deliya gamiyamiya ani wana nuwaududuna ke wana veoveola faikuya. Yaubada yana nuwadogeya gina lemelememi.  
\cls Iyayeku Paulo   